From: =?UTF-8?q?Miroslav=20Mr=C3=A1z?= <miroslav.mraz@techmania.cz>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 01:44:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH v1 6/6] media: qcom: camss: Add C-PHY support for SC7180

Add the SC7180 (CSIPHY v1.2) 3-phase C-PHY lane register table and wire
CAMSS_7180 into the C-PHY branch of csiphy_lanes_enable() so the Samsung
Galaxy A52 (a52q) main camera (S5KGW1P, 3-trio C-PHY on CSIPHY0) can
stream. This builds on David Heidelberg's C-PHY series.

The table is taken from the Qualcomm downstream CSIPHY v1.2 3-phase
register set (three trios, absolute register map, 0x200 stride, each trio
terminated by the 3-phase-select write to 0x800). It differs from the
SDM845 Gen2 1.0 3PH table (CSIPHY v1.0), so SC7180 needs its own.

For C-PHY the SC7180 common CTRL7 register must be programmed with 0x52
(instead of 0x02) per the downstream configuration; scope this to
CAMSS_7180 C-PHY so other SoCs are unaffected.

---
 .../qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c         | 134 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 131 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
index 3320c20df766..e3d6a6ce2182 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
@@ -419,6 +419,130 @@ csiphy_lane_regs lane_regs_sc7180[] = {
 	{0x0000, 0x00, 0x00, CSIPHY_DNP_PARAMS},
 };
 
